  "description": "The native payload for Vonage's OpenTok media transformers (OpenTokTransformers.xcframework 2.34.1, pod VonageClientSDKVideoTransformers), packaged for .NET for iOS. Enables background blur, background replacement and audio noise suppression. Add it alongside OpenTok.Net.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the classes that turn it on, OTVideoTransformer and OTAudioTransformer, are in that package. Without this one they return null and raise OTC_MEDIA_TRANSFORMER_OPENTOK_TRANSFORMERS_LIBRARY_NOT_LOADED at runtime.",
